  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "企業永續與綠色金融",
    "sub_ename": "CORPORATE SUSTAINABLE DEVELOPMENT AND GREEN FINANCE",
    "describe_ch": "本課程介紹聯合國永續發展目標、環境社會責任與公司治理、氣候變遷、碳排放、綠色金融及企業經營等相關議題。主題包含：環境社會責任與公司治理對企業經營管理績效的影響，企業如何製作環境社會責任與公司治理的報告。",
    "describe_eh": "This course introduces United nation sustainable development goals (SDGs), environment, social, governance (ESG), and corporate social responsibility (CSR). Those issues are related to the topics including climate change, carbon emission, reduction, and neutrality.  Financial and insurance issues related to ESG also discussed. In particular, the course discusses how business deals with the ESG issues and how the ESG affects their performance. Finally, how to make ESG report and interpret the report are also covered.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "使學生理解企業永續與永續金融的知識與課題",
      "describe_en": "Student can understand the knowledge and issues of business sustainability and sustainable finance."
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "使學生了解企業倫理與企業社會責任",
      "describe_en": "Students will be acquainted with the importance of ethical aspects and corporate social responsibility (CSR) in the business environment."
    }
  ],
